asset      trellis-original.glb
triangles  286,003  (Roblox caps a mesh at 10,000)
           must lose 96.5% to fit one mesh  <-- silhouette will not survive
size       0.20 x 0.20 x 1.00 (thinnest axis is x)
relief     0.198  (thinnest / longest span)  <-- reads FLAT at any distance
